<div class="accordion">
    <div class="accordion-item active"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('What is a Wild Rift Placement Boost?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content" style="display:block;"><p><?= t('A Wild Rift specialist completes the selected number of ranked placement matches at the beginning of a season or on an account that still has calibration games remaining.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('How many placement matches can I order?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Use the games selector to order only the placements still remaining. The displayed total and estimated completion time update automatically with the chosen amount.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Why do I need to select my previous rank?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Your previous rank and marks help estimate the expected lobby difficulty. Choosing the closest accurate value ensures correct pricing and assignment to a suitable booster.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Which Wild Rift servers are supported?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('The form lists the currently supported regions, which can include Europe, North America, Brazil, Asia Pacific, and the Middle East. Availability may vary by account region.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Can I choose Solo or Duo placements?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('Select Solo for account boosting or Duo to play together when that option is available. The order summary displays any Duo surcharge before checkout.') ?></p></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><div class="accordion-header"><h5><?= t('Is a specific placement rank guaranteed?') ?></h5></div><div class="accordion-content"><p><?= t('The booster aims for the strongest possible result, but the final rank depends on match results, previous MMR, marks, and the game\'s calibration system. A fixed final rank cannot be guaranteed.') ?></p></div></div>
</div>
